# Global Digital Transformation Readiness (CA2)

A longitudinal statistical assessment of digital infrastructure and technology development across countries and regions (`2010–2024`), framed from a **Project Management** perspective to support market prioritization and risk assessment for international digital transformation projects.

## Data Source & Reproducibility
* **Primary Source:** World Bank – World Development Indicators (WDI)
* **API Endpoint:** `https://api.worldbank.org/v2` (open access, no authentication required)
* **Data Portal:** https://databank.worldbank.org/source/world-development-indicators
* **Time Span:** `2010–2024` (annual observations, with comparative five-year windows `2010–2014` and `2020–2024`)

Raw data files (`wdi_indicators_raw.csv` and `country_metadata.csv`) are generated reproducibly by running `notebooks/CA2_Digital_Transformation.ipynb` and stored in `data/raw/`.

